icit configured subprocess deadlines (including provider.codex and cross_host_review) are separate execution contracts and remain enforced.\n\nRole boundary:\n- Review only; do not change code, tests, checklist status, or story metadata.\n- This is a story-level dispatch: review every checklist item and the integrated change, not one selected item.\n\nRequired reading:\n1. .lattice/story/actives/B-137a/background.md\n2. .lattice/story/actives/B-137a/plan.md\n3. .lattice/story/actives/B-137a/checklist.json\n- Read the files and relatedDocs named by every checklist item, bounded by the current candidate-spec artifact.\n- Candidate routing: digest=2e238f39d5e15e10b8ff41c46712df1b8f511ab7cb6ca92e80646014af3ad8ae corpusDigest=3ffd92bd03a28537625b2567c201f6a45109dcacea8d05035d982bbaa3c02b4b candidates=docs/host-run-usage.md, docs/requirements/decisions/proof-admissibility-hardening-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/tier-c-crosshost-quorum-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/review-assurance-floor-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-llm-usage-ledger-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/review-run-binding-race.md, docs/requirements/decisions/multi-host-keyword-candidate-spec-routing-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-codex-command-boundary-execution-plan.md, docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md, packages/main/src/cli-engine.ts, packages/main/src/cli/command-catalog.ts, packages/main/src/core/autopilot-executor.ts, packages/main/src/core/codex-review-leaf.ts, packages/main/src/core/command-policy.ts, packages/main/src/core/evidence/admissibility/index.ts, packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts, packages/main/src/core/lattice-dispatch.ts, packages/main/src/core/process-fact-levels.ts, packages/main/src/core/process-fact-registry.ts, packages/main/src/core/proof-admissibility-gates.ts, packages/main/src/core/proof-admissibility.ts, packages/main/src/core/runtime-artifact-registry.